  "key_observations_html": "<div style=\"border:1px solid #C7D8E8;border-radius:10px;padding:0.75rem 0.95rem;margin:0.1rem 0 0.55rem;background:#ffffff;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(15,23,42,0.06);\"><ul style=\"margin:0.1rem 0 0 1.05rem;padding:0;color:#1F4C67;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.45;\"><li><strong>Stablecoin printed metrics were roughly flat this week:</strong> Market Cap near $289.66B (-1.8% 30D) means crypto dollar liquidity did not re-price hard\u2014incremental demand is coming from product and banking-rail headlines rather than a market-cap surge. Related: <a href=\"https://cointelegraph.com/news/hsbc-launches-redcoin-hong-kong-dollar-stablecoin-payme?utm_source=rss_feed&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">HSBC launches Hong Kong dollar stablecoin for retail payments</a> (CoinTelegraph).</li><li><strong>Stablecoin market structure remains concentration-led:</strong> leadership is still defined by a small set of large issuers/platforms; share shifts matter as much as aggregate market-cap growth. Related: <a href=\"https://www.coindesk.com/business/2026/10/23/hsbc-rolls-out-its-first-stablecoin-to-over-3-million-everyday-app-users\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">HSBC rolls out its first stablecoin to over 3 million everyday app users</a> (CoinDesk).</li><li><strong>Bank rails are pushing stablecoins into treasury workflows:</strong> That pushes demand toward treasury and settlement use cases, not only exchange trading liquidity. Related: <a href=\"https://www.coindesk.com/business/2026/10/23/sweden-s-central-bank-revives-e-krona-debate-as-stablecoins-and-digital-euro-loom\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Sweden\u2019s central bank revives e-krona debate as stablecoins and digital euro loom</a> (CoinDesk).</li></ul><p class=\"takeaways__note\">Context only\u2014not investment advice. Bullets combine on-page data with recent industry headlines.</p></div><p class=\"review-note ko-disclaimer\">Key observations are AI generated and should be reviewed for accuracy.</p>",
